tests/ui/check/ok_accuracy_proven.sky:5:1: note: `p` is accurate to 8.1e-17 relative, within the budget 1e-15
  |
5 | accuracy p within 1e-15
  | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  = note: proven by the roundoff analysis: every operation's rounding error, propagated through the program, against the exact real result
  = note: the absolute error is at most 2.0e-16

